{
  "id": "1SA.26",
  "number": "26",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Sam 26",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi akumleka Saulo ngamwulaga soni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line ŵandu ŵa ku Sifi ŵayice kwa Saulo ku Gibeya nipo ŵamsalile kuti Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵaliji mkuŵa Kwitumbi lya Hakila lilili kungopoko lyuŵa kwa cipululu ca ku Yudeya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mas 54 (Mtwe)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ŵanyakwice ndaŵi jijojo ali ajigele ŵa ngondo ŵakulimbangana ŵa mu Isalaeli ŵakwana 3,000 kwawula ku cipululu ca Sifi kukumlolesya Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵataŵile masakasa gawo ga ngondo Petumbi lya Hakila mungulugulu mwa msewu. Daudi ŵaliji ali mcipululu m'momo, nipo piŵamanyilile kuti Saulo ayice kukumlolesya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵatumisye ŵandu ŵakusonda kuti asimicisye naga Saulo ŵaliji kweleko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Daudi ŵajawile nipo ŵapaweni pa malo piŵagonile Saulo ni Abinele mwanace jwa Nele, jwamkulungwa jwa ŵa ngondo ŵa Saulo. Saulo ŵagonile mkati mwa masakasa, nipo ŵandu ŵakwe ŵamsyungulile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Daudi ŵamwusisye Ahimeleki Muhiti, ni Abishayi mkulugwawo Yowabu (mama ŵawo ŵaliji Seluya), “Mwa jemanja ŵaŵili ŵani ŵitalongane ni une ku masakasa ga Saulo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishayi ŵajanjile kuti, “Talongane ni une.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Daudi ni Abishayi ŵajile kwinjila ku masakasa ga Saulo cele ciloco nipo ŵamsimene Saulo ali agonile pasikati pa masakasa, ali asomece pasi lipanga lyakwe ciŵandika ni mtwe wakwe. Abinele ni asilikali ŵakwe ŵaliji mkugona ali amsyungulile Saulo jula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishayi ŵamsalile Daudi kuti, “Mlungu ampelece m'magongo jwenu m'myala mwenu cilo cino. Sambano mungunde kuti ngamsome nalyo lipanga lyakwe lyene kamo ni kamo ni ngatwinyicisye pasi ngingulajila soni kusoma kaŵili kose iyayi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Daudi ŵatite kuti, “Iyayi mkasimwawulaga. AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " tacimpa cilango mwangakayicila, jwalijose jwakumpweteka jwakusagulidwa jwakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵapitilisye kuŵeceta kuti, “Pali Mlungu jwa umi, une ngumanyilila kuti, AMBUJE asyene tacimwulaga Saulo, taciŵa mwa ciwa ciŵapanganyicisye AMBUJE asyene patiliciyika lisiku lyakwe, kapena ciwa ca ku ngondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE andekasisye kuti ngampweteka jwakusagulidwa jwakwe. Kwende tugambe kujigala lipanga lyakweli ni lulo lwa mesilu basi ni tujawuleje.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.24.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 24:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Daudi ŵajigele lipanga ni lulo lula yiyaliji ku mtwe kwa Saulo yila, nipo jwalakwe ni Abishayi ŵatyosile. Pangali jwalijose juŵayiweni kapena kumanyilila yiyatendeceyo atamose kwimuka pakuŵa wosope ŵene ŵagonile mnope, ligongo AMBUJE ŵagonece lugono lwakuwa nalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Daudi ŵajombwece lisi line lya ciŵataco ni kuja kukwela penani pa litumbi, kuleka lipesa lyalikulungwa pasikati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Daudi ŵaliŵilasile likuga lya asilikali ŵa Saulo lila ni Abinele ŵakwe kuti, “Abinele! Ana mkumbikana une?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abinele ŵawusisye kuti, “Ana ŵani ŵele ŵakuŵilanga ni kwajimusyaga mwenyewo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵajanjile kuti, “Ana m'mwejo ngaŵa ni mundu jwamkulungwa m'mnope mu Isalaeli mosope? Nambi ligongo cici ngamkucinjilicisya mbuje gwenu, jwali mwenye? Sampano peji mundu jwine ŵajinjile ku masakasako kuti amwulaje mbuje gwenujo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'mwejo Abinele mlepele masengo genu gakumlondela mwenye. Une ngulumbila pali AMBUJE kuti jemanja wosope ŵene mkuŵajilwa kuwa, ligongo nganimumcinjilicisya mbuje gwenu, juŵasagulidwe ni AMBUJE kuŵa mwenye. Mlole kulili lipanga ni lulo kwa mesi yiyaliji kumtwe kwakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ŵagamanyilile maloŵe ga Daudi nipo ŵamwusisye kuti, “Ana maloŵega genu m'mwejo mwanangu Daudi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵajanjile kuti, “Elo gangune maloŵega, ambuje ŵangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵapitilisye kuŵeceta kuti, “Ligongo cici ambuje ŵangu akupitilisya kundolesya une jwakutumicila jwawo? Ana ndesile cici? Ana ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wakwe wapi undesile une? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ambuje ŵangu, apikane yitinasalile une. Naga ali AMBUJE ŵiŵagalawisye wawo mtima kuti anjimucile une, mbopesi syapembesye AMBUJEWO. Nambo naga ali ŵandu AMBUJE ŵalwese. Pakuŵa andopwesye une ku cilambo ca AMBUJE kwawula ku cilambo cakupembesya milungu ja cilendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawo akakunda kuti une mbwile ku cilambo ca cilendo, kwangali AMBUJE. Ligongo cici mwenye jwa Aisalaeli akwisa kukulisosa kuti aliwulaje litekenya mpela une? Ligongo cici akusakula une mpela cijuni ca mwitinji?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ŵajanjile kuti, “Ndemwisye. Ujilani mwanangu Daudi, ngasinimtendela soni cindu cakusakala, ligongo mwukulupwisye umi wangu cele cilo cino. Nditu une ndesile yindu ya wusilu, ndisile cindu cakogoya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵajanjile kuti, “Ngati ali lipanga lyawo mwenye. Amtume jumo jwa ŵa ngondowo ayice alijigale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE akusiŵapaga upile ŵandu ŵakulupicika ni ŵakutenda yindu yambone. Lelo ŵapelece wawojo m'myala mwangu, nambo ngininawulaga wawojo mundu juŵaŵisile AMBUJE kuŵa mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpela munawukulupucisye umi wawo lelo jino, AMBUJE atende soni myoyo kwa une nipo angulupusye ku yakusawusya yangu yosope yene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
